WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:06.780
and in the ballroom of the Mayflower&nbsp;
Hotel in Washington another party&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:10.950
the dignitaries of the New Deal gather&nbsp;
for the traditional victory dinner that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.410
celebrates their triumph at the presidential polls

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:23.010
if Franklin Roosevelt's first term began&nbsp;
at a time of crisis for the country his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:27.540
second begins at a time of crisis for&nbsp;
the New Deal if his first four years&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:33.360
were marked by controversy and contention his&nbsp;
second four star for the political bombshell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:38.880
that divides the nation and splits his&nbsp;
own party he attacks the Supreme Court&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:48.580
and I defy anyone to read the opinions concerning&nbsp;
the triple-a the railroad retirement Act the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:57.010
National Recovery Act the GAVI coal Act some wage&nbsp;
law and tell us exactly what if anything we can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:03.010
do for the industrial world this section of the&nbsp;
Congress with any reasonable certainty that what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:14.800
we do will not be nullified as unconstitutional if&nbsp;
we would keep faith faith with those who had faith&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:30.130
in us if we would make democracy succeed I say&nbsp;
we must act now the president calls on Congress&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:34.810
to support his fight against what he terms the&nbsp;
horse-and-buggy decisions of the Supreme Court&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:41.350
he asks that the court be liberalized by adding&nbsp;
more and younger justices calling his program&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:47.710
court reformed but opponents denounced it&nbsp;
as court packing and Roosevelt suffers a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:54.320
jolting setback when his plan is decisively&nbsp;
rejected the New Deal honeymoon is over

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:02.780
but another major New Deal measure sponsored&nbsp;
by Senator Robert Wagner of New York is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:07.850
unexpectedly approved by the Supreme Court and&nbsp;
new life is given to the American labor move

